You are generating the AI Agent Compliance Runbook.

Inputs: SOC 2 / ISO / HIPAA control packs; Compliance Policy Pack; Evidence Pack Spec; Attestation Preparation Spec; Agent Runbook; AI Incident Response Runbook.

Produce `AI_Agent_Compliance_Runbook.md` with the ten sections declared in the SKILL.md.

Hard rules:

